      "text": "OpportunityMetadata\n- id\n- name\n- description\n- driver (which all drivers ????)\n- workspace \n- criteria\n- item identifier\n- dataset name (unique to an opportunity even if it is updated)\n- opp columns\n- status\n- input source (bq table)\n- createdBy\n",
